[00:11.12]I was rotting inside
{"我内心正在腐朽"}
[00:14.16]My inner flaws begging not to be revealed
{"内在缺陷乞求着不要暴露"}
[00:16.73]Swallowing doubt, choking it down
{"咽下疑虑 强忍窒息"}
[00:18.78]Whatever I have to do to keep it concealed
{"无论付出什么代价都要将其掩藏"}
[00:21.32]I'll leave it off the list when you ask me what
{"当你询问我性情如何时 我会刻意略过"}
[00:24.15]My disposition is
{"我的性情是"}
[00:26.41]I just avoided it
{"我只是逃避了"}
[00:28.71]Hoped it would blow over but you caught wind
{"希望风波平息 却被你察觉"}
[00:31.45]And just to see you turned me inside out
{"而你只是凝视 就将我彻底看透"}
[00:36.29]And now I see it
{"如今我终于明白"}
[00:41.24]There's no freedom in bottling it up and hiding it
{"压抑与隐藏无法带来真正的自由"}
[00:49.94]So I air it out
{"所以我选择释放"}
[00:55.08]I am my only judge
{"我才是自己的审判者"}
[00:59.65]And my self-hatred is justice enough
{"自我厌恶已是最严厉的刑罚"}
[01:19.96]Set myself free
{"解放自己"}
[01:25.36]Set free
{"获得自由"}
[01:41.50]And just to see you turned me inside out
{"而你只是凝视 就将我彻底看透"}
[01:46.14]You hung me on your wall
{"你将我悬挂在墙上"}
[01:51.00]Gazed into darkness until you saw it all
{"凝视黑暗直到看穿一切"}
[01:55.42]It wasn't what I wanted but I've never felt so free
{"这并非我所愿 却从未如此自由"}
[01:59.73]Until you turned me inside out
{"直到你将我彻底看透"}
